# Raw samples: large, stale the moment the world moves on, and one command
# away from being regenerated. Findings live in README.md instead.
*.jsonl

# ...except a BANKED BASELINE, which fails the clause that justifies ignoring
# the rest: once the world it came from is retired by `--fresh`, no command
# regenerates it. The same argument that keeps test-camera-preview.json.
# Positions only, so it is small; see README for why one exists at all.
!camera-aim/baseline-*.jsonl
